From 7fda7055aa772ea9c9b72b8cb8a7b0efcc9ab1d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "GPT-6.1-Sol" <noreply@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 20:08:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dp: propagate failures and unwind acquired resources

Check AUX transfers, training exhaustion, capacity and stream readiness.
Unwind acquired resources after enable or maintenance failure, defer link-BAD
notification, and refresh capabilities before mode/depth setup on retry.
Serialize maintenance and snooping with disable; preserve PM ownership.

Co-Authored-By: GPT-6.1-Sol (Codex CLI) <noreply@openai.com>

